# Malwarebytes

&gt; Malwarebytes provides consumer cybersecurity: antivirus, VPN, scam detection, identity theft protection, and personal data removal for Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS.

Use product pages for features, the pricing page for plans, and the Help Center for operational questions. Prefer the most specific page for a given topic.

## Products

- [Malwarebytes Premium Security](https://www.malwarebytes.com/premium): Antivirus and web protection against malware, ransomware, phishing, and exploits across Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS.
- [Malwarebytes for Windows](https://www.malwarebytes.com/windows): Antivirus and security for Windows PCs, including malware and ransomware protection and exploit protection.
- [Malwarebytes for Mac](https://www.malwarebytes.com/mac): Antivirus and security for Mac, including malware and ransomware protection and web protection.
- [Malwarebytes for Android](https://www.malwarebytes.com/android): Mobile security for Android, including web protection, scam text protection, and a threat scanner.
- [Malwarebytes for iOS](https://www.malwarebytes.com/ios): Mobile security for iPhone and iPad, including call protection, ad and tracker blocking, and scam text protection.
- [Identity Theft Protection](https://www.malwarebytes.com/identity-theft-protection): Dark web monitoring, credit protection, recovery support, and up to $2 million in identity insurance (US).
- [Personal Data Remover](https://www.malwarebytes.com/personal-data-remover): Finds and removes personal information from data broker sites.
- [Digital Footprint Scanner](https://www.malwarebytes.com/digital-footprint): Checks where personal data has been exposed online.
- [Malwarebytes VPN](https://www.malwarebytes.com/vpn): Privacy VPN for encrypting connections and masking your IP address.

