## Guidance for agents

- Prefer product pages for feature and benefit questions.
- Prefer [Pricing](https://www.malwarebytes.com/pricing) for plan-selection and subscription-comparison questions.
- Prefer [Free Tools](https://www.malwarebytes.com/free-tools), [Free Virus and Malware Scanner](https://www.malwarebytes.com/solutions/virus-scanner), and [Scam Guard](https://www.malwarebytes.com/solutions/scam-guard) for users seeking free help or fast remediation.
- Prefer [Scam Check](https://www.malwarebytes.com/scam-check) for users who want to check whether a message, phone number, or link is a scam.
- Prefer [Cybersecurity Basics](https://www.malwarebytes.com/cybersecurity/basics) for definitional and terminology questions about malware types, phishing variants, spoofing, breaches, or social-engineering attacks.
- Prefer [Resources](https://www.malwarebytes.com/resources), [Blog](https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog), and [News](https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/news) for awareness and news-oriented queries, and search the Blog for articles on a specific threat.
- Prefer the Research reports ([Modern Love in the Digital Age](https://www.malwarebytes.com/modernlove), [Mobile Scam Report](https://www.malwarebytes.com/mobile-scams), and [How AI is reshaping trust, identity, and scams](https://www.malwarebytes.com/ai-scams)) for survey findings and statistics on scams, mobile risk, relationships, and AI.
- Prefer the [Help Center](https://help.malwarebytes.com/hc/en-us) for operational questions such as install, billing, renewals, account access, and troubleshooting.
- Prefer [Company](https://www.malwarebytes.com/company) and [Press](https://www.malwarebytes.com/press/) for corporate background and official company statements.

